  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/04/IMG_7080.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>Gran animaci&oacute;n en la Font de Dins, en Onda, con el primer pase de Sent&iacute;o Grupo Rociero hasta la hora de comer.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/04/IMG_7128.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>En La Cantina Colonial, un plato de paella y una cerveza por 4&euro;, para animar todav&iacute;a m&aacute; la estancia, adem&aacute;s del rebujito.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/04/IMG_7119.jpg\" style=\"height: 720px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>Habr&aacute; dos pases m&aacute;s por la tarde y por la noche, a las 17 y a las 22 horas.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sentiofontdinsmigdia/img_7067.jpg\" alt=\"img_7067\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sentiofontdinsmigdia/img_7068.jpg\" alt=\"img_7068\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sentiofontdinsmigdia/img_7070.jpg\" alt=\"img_7070\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sentiofontdinsmigdia/img_7072.jpg\" alt=\"img_7072\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sentiofontdinsmigdia/img_7076.jpg\" alt=\"img_7076\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sentiofontdinsmigdia/img_7079.jpg\" alt=\"img_7079\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sentiofontdinsmigdia/img_7080.jpg\" alt=\"img_7080\" style=\"max-width:100%;heig